<title>USA: Tevecap SA issues $250 mln debt, yld 12.625 pct.</title>
<headline>Tevecap SA issues $250 mln debt, yld 12.625 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement debt issue from Tevecap SA, a Brazilian television distribution company, was priced on Thursday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>The deal was priced via a Chase Securities Inc group.</p>
<p>BORROWER TEVECAP SA</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 12-5/8 PCT MATURITY 11/26/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A. LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 12-5/8 PCT  PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 650 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTES: PRICED OVER 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>	 FOUR-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR $75 MLN AT 112-5/8</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
